{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51321","headline":"语录诗 · 无住","name":"语录诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"慧眼近空心，非关髑髅孔。\n对面说不识，饶你母姓董。\n（敦煌写本《历代法实记》所附（《历代法宝记》云此爲无住引王梵志诗。\n此作无住，似误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无住","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}